              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "способствовать (sposóbstvovat) — \"to contribute to, to promote\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Спорт способствует здоровому сну. Sport sposóbstvuyet zdoróvomu snu. Sport promotes healthy sleep."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective; present способствую, способствуешь. It takes the dative: способствовать (sposóbstvovat) успеху. Bookish."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "способствовать (sposóbstvovat) is built on способ \"a way, a means\" with the verb suffix -ствовать: to be a means to something. The further origin of способ is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
